      "rkaf:appliesInJurisdiction": [],
      "rkaf:applicabilityCondition": "In determining whether an employee has been employed for at least 12 months by the employer, when absence from work is due to or necessitated by USERRA-covered service, and subject to the limitation that this section does not provide any greater entitlement than available under USERRA."
    },
    {
