        "@value": "The period of absence from work due to or necessitated by USERRA-covered service must also be counted in determining whether the employee has been employed for at least 12 months by the employer; however, this section does not provide any greater entitlement to the employee than would be available under the USERRA.",
        "@language": "en"
      },
      "rkaf:assertionPolarity": "rkaf:affirmed"
    },
